  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gloom-sh/gloomberb/zipball/v0.14.1",
  "body": "## Highlights\n\n- **Keybindings are yours.** Rebind every global and pane key from the Help pane, the command bar, or `gloomberb config set keybindings.*`. Any command bar text can go on a chord, so `F5` can be `CN` and `Alt+1` can be `DES AAPL`. (#933, #934)\n- **A broken plugin no longer stops the app.** A plugin that fails to register is marked failed in the Plugins pane, with the reason, and everything else starts. (#932)\n- **Move your data folder.** `GLOOMBERB_HOME` relocates the whole `~/.gloomberb` folder: config, database, plugins and plugin cache. (#932)\n- **TV stops burning a core.** A player stranded by a reload is reaped at startup, and playback no longer decodes more than the pane can show. (#937)\n- **Analyst targets get a chart.** The consensus target is plotted from the dated targets in the ratings history, and the pane's context moves to the status bar. (#939)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- Jobs adds evergreen and contract shares and an open roles column. (#940)\n- The chat sidebar gets consistent sections, a foldable channel list and a drag handle. (#941)\n- Help renders its shortcut and function lists as real tables. (#938, #944)\n- Price-only charts use the source's real interval list, and Auto steps down when a preset's interval is unsupported. (#935, #936)\n- Package-managed installs (Nix, distro packages) say to update through the package manager instead of failing on a read-only filesystem. (#932)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.14.0...v0.14.1)\n"
}
